div.head:
336. Memorandum From the Special Assistant to the Secretary of State (Raphel)
                    to the Deputy Secretary of State (Christopher) and the Under Secretary of State
                    for Political Affairs (Newsom)

div.p:
—We also realize that we may well be unable to dissuade Pakistan from proceeding
                    down the nuclear road and may well be faced, within the next two to five years,
                    with a nuclear Pakistan;
